* ''Contracted members sync the working layer'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"We want contracted members to have synced access to the 'working layer' too, even cross operator."//). A shared wiki's working layer rests as one realm-workbench CRDT that every member its contract seats syncs; edits merge in the CRDT, and canon stays promotion-gated. Landed for one operator's faces (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/cabal-realm#/the-workbench`>>); the cross-operator join stays OWED at the realm's member consult.

